AB  - This method adopts a knowledge graph based approach to achieve application security requirement analysis. Through legal and regulatory knowledge and application security knowledge, knowledge graph inference operations are carried out, threat modeling is performed, and the isolation of search content is solved through the graph. The unified entry search of all subject domain data in security scenarios is achieved, which can solve the problems of large amounts of legal, regulatory, and security risk information data and low efficiency in obtaining effective mechanism information, By leveraging the automated verification of security requirements, the speed of application security requirement analysis can be greatly improved.  © 2023 ACM.
